From 764984ce729bd283627996731757d9894c440945 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:31:12 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] shared: flat Launcher surfaces and configurable folder
 outline

Squashed from:
- 0001-shared-flat-launcher-surfaces
- 0002-shared-configurable-folder-outline

Change-Id: Ia8b3098fea9f80f71ee4821509a7ecb390320404

Long-press popups: one edge per surface (containers and direct items are white and outlined, items inside a container stay transparent and unstroked); flat popups have no fill-only arrow. Widget picker search box and app rows take an overlayable outline (widget_picker_outline_width, default 0).
